<title>HONG KONG: HK Parkview interim net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>HK Parkview interim net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   16.40  vs 0.72</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    87.30  vs 3.85</p>
<p>    Turnover		     343.01 vs 249.32</p>
<p>    Company name		 The Hong Kong Parkview Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 2-6, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 7, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Parkview engages in property investment, passenger vessel operations, shipbuilding and marine engineering.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
